WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:12.460
Come on, help me with something, man.

2
00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:13.460
Okay, sorry.

3
00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:15.460
Every time it's just: sorry.

4
00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:18.460
Okay, what do you want me to help with? – Well, do something, come on.

5
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:19.460
Do you want me to cut this cucumber?

6
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:23.460
Not the cucumber, don't touch my cucumber, because you always cut it thick and then it doesn't turn out well.

7
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:26.460
Here, a tomato. – A tomato.

8
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:39.900
How do you want me to cut this? – Not like that, you can't cut like that, look.

9
00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:45.220
Andrija, you can't chop a tomato so finely.

10
00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:49.380
It'll just turn into some kind of slush in the salad, all juice.

11
00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:55.860
So, nicely for a salad, a bit coarser.

12
00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:59.860
Like this. Enough. Like this.

13
00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:01.940
What are you doing? – And what are you doing?

14
00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:03.820
What, can I put it in the salad in halves?

15
00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:05.820
Come on, man, cut normally, into slices.

16
00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.110
No, it's no use. You ruined the last tomato.

17
00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:15.970
And why are you hanging around the kitchen? – And why are you hanging around, love?

18
00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:22.430
I'll do it myself.
